t":"Составь: «Ключ под столом».","position":4,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","label":"under"},{"id":"t2","label":"is"},{"id":"t3","label":"the"},{"id":"t4","label":"The"},{"id":"t5","label":"table."},{"id":"t6","label":"key"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t4","t6","t2","t1","t3","t5"]},"reference_answer":["t4","t6","t2","t1","t3","t5"],"incorrect_answer":["t6","t2","t1","t3","t5","t4"],"explanation":"Порядок: предмет The key, связка is, место under the table."},{"id":"5af54ac3-d112-5b08-b2a9-a5481b788b67","lesson_id":"004533e0-009f-57c1-91fb-994fea5be9c2","kind":"matching","prompt":"Сопоставь предметы комнаты.","position":5,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l1","label":"shelf"},{"id":"l2","label":"desk"},{"id":"l3","label":"lamp"},{"id":"l4","label":"chair"}],"right":[{"id":"r1","label":"стул"},{"id":"r2","label":"лампа"},{"id":"r3","label":"письменный стол"},{"id":"r4","label":"полка"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l1":"r4","l2":"r3","l3":"r2","l4":"r1"}},"reference_answer":{"l1":"r4","l2":"r3","l3":"r2","l4":"r1"},"incorrect_answer":{"l1":"r3","l2":"r2","l3":"r1","l4":"r4"},"explanation":"Shelf — полка, desk — письменный стол, lamp — лампа, chair — стул."},{"id":"fb143e13-6a22-5451-9c81-d6e22bb47d25","lesson_id":"004533e0-009f-57c1-91fb-994fea5be9c2","kind":"reading","prompt":"Где находится сумка Нины?","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"By the door."},{"id":"o2","label":"On the shelf."},{"id":"o3","label":"Under the desk."}],"passage":"This is Nina’s room. There is a desk by the window. Her bag is under the desk. Two books are on the shelf."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"В тексте: Her bag is under the desk. Книги, а не сумка, находятся на полке."},{"id":"21f87340-eaa3-5f7d-8e21-425978cc7c39","lesson_id":"004533e0-009f-57c1-91fb-994fea5be9c2","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи описание предметов.","position":7,"public_payload":{"source":"На полке две книги."},"answer_key":