:"It will leave later than planned."},{"id":"o3","label":"It has arrived early."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Delayed сообщает о более позднем отправлении, не обязательно об отмене."},{"id":"aa58691a-32ad-583b-b4c6-c8600a6f24be","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение подходящим словом или краткой формой.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"How ___ is the delay?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["long"]},"reference_answer":"long","incorrect_answer":"many","explanation":"How long спрашивает о длительности."},{"id":"3d9e7d1c-d3d3-5e8a-af0b-9afd804f3303","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери вопрос о следующем поезде.","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"does"},{"id":"t4","label":"the"},{"id":"t5","label":"next"},{"id":"t6","label":"train"},{"id":"t7","label":"leave?"},{"id":"t1","label":"What"},{"id":"t2","label":"time"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t1"],"explanation":"После does глагол leave без -s."},{"id":"b6de7952-7b50-5a39-9551-509edafec711","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь вспомогательный глагол","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"When do the next bus arrive?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["When does the next bus arrive?"]},"reference_answer":"When does the next bus arrive?","incorrect_answer":"When do the next bus arrive?","explanation":"The next bus — единственное число, поэтому does."},{"id":"981e3310-c209-5b35-b3ec-3fd1f380318c","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи на английский.","position":5,"public_payload":{"source":"Поезд опаздывает на двадцать минут."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The train is twenty minutes late.","The train is delayed by twenty minutes."]},"reference_answer":"The train is twenty minutes late.","incorrect_answer":"The train is twenty minutes early.","explanation":"Late/delayed — опоздание; early — раньше срока."},{"id":"5c99af05-d8b2-548e-b041-3166b86a5b4f","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"reading","prompt":"Нужно ли пассажирам задержанного поезда покупать новые билеты?","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Yes, all tickets are cancelled."},{"id":"o2","label":"Only passengers on platform four must pay again."},{"id":"o3","label":"No, their tickets remain valid."}],"passage":"The 10:15 train to York is delayed by thirty minutes because of a signal problem. It will still leave from platform four. Passengers for Leeds should use platform two for the 10:25 train. The announcement says that tickets for the delayed York service remain valid, so passengers do not need to buy new ones."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Remain valid означает, что прежние билеты продолжают действовать."},{"id":"2d8b938b-52a9-5258-93b1-d4d241375a84","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Объясни, что он задержан, но не отменён.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"No, it's delayed. It should leave in twenty minutes."},{"id":"o2","label":"Yes, it leaves every morning."},{"id":"o3","label":"No, your seat is by the window."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Passenger","text":"Has the train been cancelled?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Ответ различает отмену и задержку."},{"id":"d9c0d933-d561-5f10-9528-aa89d2aee4f1","lesson_id":"3a61765e-f01c-581d-ade9-6a838aac0668","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово для места посадки на поезд.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"gate number for boarding a plane"},{"id":"o2","label":"platform"},{"id":"o3","label":"bus driver"}],"sentence":"The train leaves from ___ three."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Для железной дороги используется platform; остальные варианты не обозначают платформу."},{"id":"b2ee0c5b-70b6-5e72-9d2b-e2cf77a0aef4","lesson_id":"f39053b3-b69c-5316-9e54-ddc8585e4d45","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Как сказать, что сумка слишком тяжёлая?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"The bag is heavy too much."},{"id":"o2","label":"The bag is enough heavy."},{"id":"o3","label":"The bag is too heavy."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Too стоит перед прилагательным heavy."},{"id":"4df68631-5a60-556b-8693-d3c2b20da69b","lesson_id":"f39053b3-b69c-5316-9e54-ddc8585e4d45","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение подходящим словом или краткой формой.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The room isn't warm ___ to sleep in."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["enough"]},"reference_answer":"enough","incorrect_answer":"too","explanation":"Enough после warm указывает на достаточность температуры."},{"id":"db59c524-344f-58ff-86af-0ba33bd082db","lesson_id":"f39053b3-b69c-5316-9e54-ddc8585e4d45","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери: «Эта коробка достаточно большая».","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"is"},{"id":"t4","label":"big"},{"id":"t5","label":"enough."},{"id":"t1","label":"This"},{"id":"t2","label":"box"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t1"],"explanation":"Enough следует за прилагательным big."},{"id":"601a142a-6cb0-5249-958a-18d79485c4b4","lesson_id":"f39053b3-b69c-5316-9e54-ddc8585e4d45","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь порядок слов","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The shelf is enough strong for these books."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The shelf is strong 