оту в поддержке?","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"He wanted to avoid communicating with colleagues."},{"id":"o2","label":"He enjoyed helping people with technical problems."},{"id":"o3","label":"He had already been offered a job by his friend."}],"passage":"Jon wanted to change jobs, but he was unsure where to begin. A friend suggested making a list of the tasks he enjoyed doing. Jon realised that he liked helping colleagues solve technical problems and avoided working alone for long periods. He decided to apply for a support role and hoped to find a team that valued patient communication."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Его интерес к помощи людям соответствует выбранной роли."},{"id":"3658dceb-a04a-5f76-afc8-c79045a2ab30","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Предложи заранее отправлять повестку.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"I suggest to sending the agenda in advance."},{"id":"o2","label":"I suggest send the agenda in advance."},{"id":"o3","label":"I suggest sending the agenda in advance."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Colleague","text":"How can we make our meetings shorter?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Suggest + sending — правильная модель."},{"id":"a333058e-a693-5f85-8077-3c2586ff383c","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери форму после looking forward to.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"meeting"},{"id":"o2","label":"meet"},{"id":"o3","label":"met"}],"sentence":"I'm looking forward to ___ the new team."},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"To здесь предлог в устойчивом выражении, поэтому после него -ing."}]}$curriculum_package$::jsonb);
